    <briefdescription>
<para>Get subsets of an execution place. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This computes a vector of execution places which are the partition of the input execution place divided with a specific partitioning granularity. One may partition a place into devices, or green contexts, for example.</para>
<para>An iterator is provided to dispatch computation over the subplaces. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
